DESCRIPTION >
    Integrations overview: most recent event (any type), for install-status
    display. Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port
    of api/routes/integrations.js:18-24 (queryName 'integ_install').
    Typed-column translation: properties.site_id -> site_id; SELECT `event` ->
    `event_type` (the renamed/typed discriminator column); properties.page_url
    -> page_url (typed, String Nullable per §2.6). Source has NO event_type
    filter (matches any event) — preserved exactly. No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE integ_install_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT event_type, timestamp, page_url
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 1

TYPE endpoint
